<template>
  <section class="node-manager" aria-label="判题节点管理">
    <div class="node-heading"><div><h3>判题节点</h3><p>按资源容量自动分配任务，在线节点共同提供算力。</p></div><div><OjActionButton :loading="loading" @click="load" icon="refresh">刷新</OjActionButton><OjActionButton type="primary" @click="edit()" icon="plus">添加独立节点</OjActionButton></div></div>
    <div class="node-overview"><div><span>在线节点</span><strong>{{ pool.online || 0 }}<small> / {{ pool.nodes?.length || 0 }}</small></strong></div><div><span>总并发容量</span><strong>{{ pool.capacity || 0 }}<small> 个任务</small></strong></div><div><span>可用任务位</span><strong class="node-free">{{ pool.availableSlots || 0 }}</strong></div><div class="node-policy"><i /><span>资源负载均衡<small>节点资源每 5 秒更新</small></span></div></div>
    <el-alert v-if="error" :title="error" type="error" :closable="false" />
    <div v-if="loading && !pool.nodes" class="node-grid" aria-busy="true"><div v-for="i in 2" :key="i" class="node-skeleton"><i /><i /><i /></div></div>
    <div v-else class="node-grid">
      <article v-for="n in pool.nodes || []" :key="n.id" class="node-card" :class="{'node-offline':!n.online}">
        <header><span class="node-server-icon"><OjIcon name="server" :size="25" /></span><div><h4>{{ n.name }}</h4><span>{{ n.builtin ? '容器内置' : '独立服务器' }} · #{{ n.id }}</span></div><span class="node-state" :class="stateTone(n)"><i />{{ states[n.state] || '未知' }}</span></header>
        <p class="node-address">{{ n.endpoint }}</p>
        <div class="node-metrics"><div><span>CPU 负载 <b>{{ metric(n.cpuPercent) }}%</b></span><div class="node-meter"><i :style="{width:percent(n.cpuPercent,100)+'%'}" /></div><small>{{ metric(n.cpuCores) }} 核资源配额</small></div><div><span>判题内存 <b>{{ metric(n.memoryUsedMb) }} / {{ metric(n.memoryMb) }} MiB</b></span><div class="node-meter memory"><i :style="{width:percent(n.memoryUsedMb,n.memoryMb)+'%'}" /></div><small>宿主机剩余 {{ metric(n.hostAvailableMb) }} MiB</small></div></div>
        <div class="node-workload"><div><span>正在执行</span><strong>{{ n.active }}<small> / {{ n.capacity }}</small></strong><em>{{ n.freeSlots }} 个空闲任务位</em></div><svg viewBox="0 0 180 48" role="img" aria-label="近期 CPU 负载趋势"><path d="M0 47H180" stroke="#e5edf5"/><polyline :points="spark(n.id)" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
        <p v-if="n.state==='INCOMPATIBLE'" class="node-message error">语言运行环境版本不匹配，请使用平台提供的节点镜像。</p><p v-else-if="n.error && n.state==='ERROR'" class="node-message error">{{ n.error }}</p><p v-else-if="n.state==='STOPPED'" class="node-message">判题进程已停止，启动后即可参与任务分配。</p><p v-else-if="!n.online" class="node-message error">连接已中断，已从任务分配中移除。</p><p v-else class="node-message">上次资源上报 {{ date(n.lastSeen) }}</p>
        <footer><OjActionButton v-if="!n.enabled || ['STOPPED','ERROR'].includes(n.state)" type="primary" :loading="busy[n.id]" :disabled="n.state==='STOPPING'" @click="control(n,'start')" icon="power">启动节点</OjActionButton><OjActionButton v-else :loading="busy[n.id]" :disabled="n.state==='STOPPING'" @click="control(n,'stop')" icon="power">停止节点</OjActionButton><OjActionButton link type="primary" @click="edit(n)" icon="settings">连接配置</OjActionButton><OjActionButton v-if="!n.builtin && !n.enabled && !Number(n.active)" link type="danger" @click="remove(n)" icon="trash">移除</OjActionButton></footer>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="node-guide"><span><strong>接入更多算力</strong><small>使用同一版本的独立节点镜像。节点报告容量，断开或满载时自动避让。</small></span><OjActionButton @click="guide=true" icon="file">部署说明</OjActionButton></div>
    <el-dialog align-center v-model="formOpen" :title="editing?'节点连接配置':'添加独立判题节点'" width="min(580px,95vw)" :close-on-click-modal="false">
      <el-form label-position="top"><el-form-item label="节点名称"><el-input v-model="form.name" maxlength="80" placeholder="例如：计算服务器 A" /></el-form-item><el-form-item label="控制服务地址"><el-input v-model="form.endpoint" :disabled="builtin" placeholder="https://judge.example.com 或 http://10.0.0.2:5051" /></el-form-item><el-form-item v-if="!builtin" label="节点连接令牌"><el-input v-model="form.token" type="password" show-password autocomplete="new-password" :placeholder="editing?'留空表示保留原令牌':'填写节点部署时配置的连接令牌'" /></el-form-item><el-form-item label="允许的并发上限"><el-input-number v-model="form.maxConcurrency" :min="1" :max="builtin?1:32" :disabled="builtin" /><p class="node-form-help">实际容量受节点 CPU、内存与并发能力约束；平台总并发上限为 32。</p></el-form-item><el-alert v-if="editing && !builtin" title="修改地址或令牌前需要停止节点。" type="info" :closable="false" /><p v-if="editing && !builtin" class="node-form-help">资源上报地址：<code>{{ origin }}/api/oj-nodes/{{ editing }}/heartbeat</code></p></el-form>
      <template #footer><OjActionButton @click="formOpen=false" icon="close">取消</OjActionButton><OjActionButton type="primary" :loading="saving" @click="save" icon="save">保存节点</OjActionButton></template>
    </el-dialog>
    <el-dialog align-center v-model="guide" title="部署独立判题节点" width="min(740px,95vw)"><div class="node-instructions"><p>在 Linux Docker 服务器安装节点。每个并发任务至少预留 640 MiB 判题内存，建议额外给操作系统保留 512 MiB。</p><ol><li>下载到同一目录：<a href="/admin/judger-node/install.sh" download>部署脚本</a> · <a href="/admin/judger-node/prepare.py" download>资源准备脚本</a> · <a href="/admin/judger-node/seccomp.json" download>沙箱配置</a></li><li>创建令牌文件并启动节点。<pre>{{ guideCode }}</pre></li><li>添加节点地址与令牌。公网使用 HTTPS，内网支持 HTTP；5051 端口只向平台服务器开放。</li><li>添加后在连接配置中复制上报地址，设置节点的 NODE_PUSH_URL 并重启节点容器。平台也会主动探测节点。</li></ol><p>停止节点会结束判题进程并释放内存。控制服务保留，用于远程启动；运行任务会尝试切换到其他可用节点。</p></div></el-dialog>
  </section>
</template>
<script setup>
import OjActionButton from '@/components/OjActionButton.vue'
import OjIcon from '@/components/OjIcon.vue'
import { ref, reactive, onMounted, onBeforeUnmount } from 'vue'
import { ElMessage, ElMessageBox } from 'element-plus'
import request from '@/utils/request'
const pool=ref({}),loading=ref(false),error=ref(''),busy=reactive({}),series=reactive({}),formOpen=ref(false),saving=ref(false),editing=ref(null),builtin=ref(false),guide=ref(false),origin=location.origin
const form=reactive({name:'',endpoint:'',token:'',maxConcurrency:1})
const guideCode=['openssl rand -hex 32 > node.token','chmod 600 node.token','sudo bash install.sh --token-file "$PWD/node.token" --cpu 2 --memory-mb 1280 --concurrency 2'].join('\n')
const states={RUNNING:'运行中',STOPPED:'已停止',STARTING:'启动中',STOPPING:'停止中',OFFLINE:'离线',ERROR:'异常',INCOMPATIBLE:'版本不匹配'}
let timer,disposed=false,generation=0
function stateTone(n){return {online:n.state==='RUNNING',moving:['STARTING','STOPPING'].includes(n.state),failed:['ERROR','OFFLINE','INCOMPATIBLE'].includes(n.state)}}
const metric=n=>n==null?'—':Math.round(Number(n)*10)/10
const percent=(n,total)=>Math.max(0,Math.min(100,100*Number(n||0)/Math.max(1,Number(total||0))))
const date=t=>t?new Date(Number(t)).toLocaleTimeString('zh-CN',{hour12:false}):'尚未连接'
function spark(id){const values=series[id]||[0,0];return values.map((v,i)=>`${i*180/Math.max(1,values.length-1)},${46-percent(v,100)*.42}`).join(' ')}
async function load(){if(disposed)return;const version=++generation;loading.value=true;try{const {data}=await request.get('/api/admin/oj/nodes');if(version!==generation||disposed)return;pool.value=data;error.value='';for(const n of data.nodes){series[n.id]=[...(series[n.id]||[]),n.online?Number(n.cpuPercent||0):0].slice(-24)}}catch(e){if(!disposed)error.value=e.message}finally{if(version===generation)loading.value=false}}
function edit(node){editing.value=node?.id||null;builtin.value=!!node?.builtin;Object.assign(form,{name:node?.name||'',endpoint:node?.endpoint||'',token:'',maxConcurrency:node?.maxConcurrency||1});formOpen.value=true}
async function save(){if(!form.name.trim()||!form.endpoint.trim()){ElMessage.warning('请填写节点名称与控制服务地址');return}saving.value=true;try{await request[editing.value?'put':'post']('/api/admin/oj/nodes'+(editing.value?'/'+editing.value:''),form);form.token='';formOpen.value=false;await load();ElMessage.success('节点配置已保存')}catch{}finally{saving.value=false}}
async function control(n,action){if(action==='stop'&&Number(n.active)>0){try{await ElMessageBox.confirm(`当前有 ${n.active} 个任务正在运行，停止后将尝试切换至其他节点。`,'停止判题节点',{type:'warning',confirmButtonText:'停止节点',cancelButtonText:'取消'})}catch{return}}busy[n.id]=true;try{await request.post(`/api/admin/oj/nodes/${n.id}/${action}`);await load();ElMessage.success(action==='start'?'已发送启动指令':'已停止分配新任务，正在停止进程')}catch{}finally{busy[n.id]=false;await load()}}
async function remove(n){try{await ElMessageBox.confirm(`移除“${n.name}”的连接配置？`,'移除节点',{confirmButtonText:'移除',cancelButtonText:'取消'});await request.delete('/api/admin/oj/nodes/'+n.id);await load()}catch{}}
onMounted(()=>{load();timer=setInterval(()=>{if(!document.hidden&&!loading.value)load()},5000)})
onBeforeUnmount(()=>{disposed=true;++generation;clearInterval(timer);form.token=''})
</script>
<style scoped>
.node-manager{margin-bottom:38px;padding-bottom:32px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5ecf4;color:#38546f}.node-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:center}.node-eyebrow{font:600 10px ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:2px;color:#7e9cbb}.node-heading h3{font-size:22px;margin:8px 0}.node-heading p{font-size:12px;color:#8b9eb3;line-height:1.7}.node-heading>div:last-child{display:flex;gap:10px;flex:none}.node-overview{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));border:1px solid #e4edf6;border-radius:14px;margin:22px 0;overflow:hidden;background:#f7faff}.node-overview>div{padding:20px;border-right:1px solid #e4edf6}.node-overview>div:last-child{border:0}.node-overview span{display:block;font-size:11px;color:#8096ad}.node-overview strong{display:block;font:600 30px ui-monospace,monospace;margin-top:10px;color:#345576}.node-overview strong small{font:11px sans-serif;color:#92a5b9}.node-overview .node-free{color:#258775}.node-policy{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.node-policy>i{width:8px;height:8px;background:#47a890;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 0 5px #47a89015}.node-policy small{display:block;font-size:10px;color:#a0afbf;margin-top:8px}.node-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px}.node-card{border:1px solid #dae6f2;background:#fff;border-radius:15px;padding:23px;transition:box-shadow .2s,border-color .2s;min-width:0}.node-card:hover{border-color:#bcd4eb;box-shadow:0 8px 24px #305e8910}.node-card header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.node-server-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:43px;height:43px;border:1px solid #deebf9;border-radius:12px;background:#f2f8ff;color:#6b99c8;flex:none}.node-server-icon svg{width:25px;height:25px}.node-card h4{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 6px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.node-card header>div{min-width:0}.node-card header>div>span{font-size:10px;color:#97a9bc}.node-state{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-left:auto;border-radius:6px;background:#f1f4f8;color:#8c9cae;padding:6px 8px;font-size:10px;white-space:nowrap}.node-state i{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}.node-state.online{color:#398e78;background:#edf8f3}.node-state.online i{animation:nodePulse 2s infinite}.node-state.moving{color:#4f8bc8;background:#edf6ff}.node-state.moving i{width:9px;height:9px;border:1.5px solid #b6d4f0;border-top-color:currentColor;background:transparent;animation:nodeSpin 1s linear infinite}.node-state.failed{color:#bd7373;background:#fff1f0}.node-address{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace;color:#9caebf;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin:15px 0 23px}.node-metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.node-metrics span{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;font-size:11px;color:#7d94ac;flex-wrap:wrap}.node-metrics b{font:500 10px ui-monospace,monospace;color:#587b9e}.node-meter{height:5px;border-radius:8px;background:#eef3f8;margin:11px 0;overflow:hidden}.node-meter i{height:100%;display:block;background:#72a8da;transition:width 1s ease}.node-meter.memory i{background:#73b7a3}.node-metrics small{font-size:10px;color:#a0afbf}.node-workload{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin:24px 0 14px;padding:17px 0;border-top:1px solid #edf2f7;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f7}.node-workload span{font-size:11px;color:#8499ad}.node-workload strong{display:block;font:600 26px ui-monospace,monospace;margin:7px 0}.node-workload strong small{font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:#a5b4c5}.node-workload em{font-style:normal;font-size:10px;color:#71a08c}.node-workload svg{width:43%;max-width:180px;color:#85abd0}.node-message{font-size:11px;line-height:1.8;color:#99aabd;min-height:20px}.node-message.error{color:#be7c75}.node-card footer{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}.node-card footer .el-button+.el-button{margin-left:0}.node-offline{background:#fafbfd}.node-offline .node-workload svg{color:#c3ced9}.node-guide{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px;margin-top:20px;background:#f6f9fd;border-radius:12px}.node-guide strong{display:block;font-size:12px}.node-guide small{display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;color:#95a5b8;line-height:1.7}.node-form-help,.node-instructions{font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:#8195ac}.node-form-help code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.node-instructions li{margin:16px 0}.node-instructions pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding:14px;border-radius:8px;background:#f4f7fb;font:11px/1.8 ui-monospace,monospace}.node-instructions a{color:#4e87bf}.node-skeleton{border:1px solid #e4edf7;border-radius:15px;padding:25px}.node-skeleton i{display:block;height:35px;margin:20px 0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f1f5fa,#fafcfe,#f1f5fa);background-size:200%;border-radius:8px;animation:nodeShimmer 1.5s linear infinite}@keyframes nodePulse{50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 4px #398e7818}}@keyframes nodeSpin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}@keyframes nodeShimmer{to{background-position:-200%}}@media(max-width:950px){.node-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.node-overview{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.node-overview>div:nth-child(2){border-right:0}.node-overview>div:nth-child(-n+2){border-bottom:1px solid #e4edf6}.node-heading{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}}@media(max-width:500px){.node-card{padding:17px}.node-metrics{gap:10px}.node-guide{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.node-card header{gap:8px}.node-card h4{font-size:13px}.node-state{font-size:9px;padding:5px}.node-overview>div{padding:15px}.node-policy{gap:8px}.node-policy span{font-size:10px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.node-state i,.node-skeleton i{animation:none!important}.node-meter i,.node-card{transition:none}}

.node-card footer{gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap}.node-heading>div:last-child{flex-wrap:wrap}.node-manager :deep(.el-dialog__footer){display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
</style>
